ich is  basically meant to add Max 8 magnets to  older phones that don't have Max save so  you can actually use the maximum  accessories in this video and even  better countless people have used this  macsafe sticker to add magnetic wireless  charging to their Android phones as well  since macsafe is currently exclusive to  Apple and no other smartphone brand can  match it or on the other hand let's say  you already have a case without Max  magnets built in this would essentially  add Max save to any case out there just  use the included guide to line it up  around the wireless charging coils on  the inside of the phone which you can  find using a teardown and you're good to  go getting into number four we have the  mag disk from our sponsor Galileo gear  which is the world's smallest folding  Max save charging stand that's made  completely out of anodized aluminum  which Fold It Down protects your macsafe  cable plug while being four quarters  thin and it unfolds into a 60 degree Max  safe charging stand so check it out in  the description below now for number  five we have the gooseneck Max stand  that we've previously tested and it's  just so useful that we had to show it  off again this accessory essentially  allows you to clamp the gooseneck down  anywhere you want to like a tabletop a  nightstand a bed frame a camera tripod a  fence or anywhere you can possibly  imagine and then you simply adjust the  impressively strong gooseneck into any  orientation you'd like you can even use  it for taking family photos on a timer  wherever you're at instead of having to  swap people around to take photos and  probably the most useful idea is to  position the mount over your bed to  enjoy videos or movies without having to  hold your iPhone or even better you can  position it next to your laptop or even  use it as your webcam for FaceTime by  simply pointing the rear camera at your  face and it's only 25 bucks on Amazon so  it's actually pretty inexpensive as well  now getting into number six we have the  weighty max safe carbon charger which  has been my single most favorite Maxim  accessory ever since I got one year  years ago and it's honestly so good that  I purchased a second one for my second  car because I missed it every time I  drove it so we had to get another one  since it's only 25 bucks on Amazon right  now and it literally comes with  everything you need including a 12 volt  power adapter with an additional Port  the charging cable and the max safe  wireless charging Mount itself with a  very convenient adjustable ball joint  for mounting into your van this Maxim  accessory has changed my life since I  like to use my iPhone naked and it  allows me to mount it next to my  steering wheel all while it actually  charges my iPhone as well and for just  25 dollars it's a steal of a deal now  for number seven we also have another  Max Save carvet Mount which Max has  recently switched to instead of using  the way T Max save charger like I have  and the reason he switched was because  he actually uses Apple carplay in his  truck which requires the lightning cable  to be plugged in to connect so wireless  charging doesn't really matter to him in  fact when he used to have the weighty  charger his icon 13 Pros display with  dimmed down because it would overheat  while using GPS so he would sometimes  use it unplugged anyway so the Belkin  Mount was perfect for him because it  features a stronger magnetic connection  and you can easily wrap your lightning  cable around it making it more  convenient to plug in now this one's a  bit more expensive at 40 bucks on Amazon  but it's made with higher build quality  and he absolutely loves it moving on to  the number eight top Max save accessory  it's actually Belkin's Max save Puck  charger which is meant to directly  compete with Apple's original Max save  Puck since it supports the full 15 watts  of wireless charging speed but it  actually charges faster in our testing  yes the Belkin charging puck charged the  iPhone 12 that we tested up to 100 30  minutes sooner than Apple's maxite  version not only that but the cable is  braided so it's higher quality than  Apples and it's 6.6 feet long instead of  three on Apple's version making it more  convenient to use and it has a nice  little strap so you can more  conveniently wrap it up for taking with  you on the go even better the magnetic  connection is actually stronger than  Apple's version since it's a bit thicker  and it comes with a built-in kickstand  which is a nice little touch for number  nine we have esr's three in one Halo  lock charger with cryo boost now we've  tested many three-in-one charges before  some at 150 and other at 50 bucks and  this is the best bang for the buck  because it's only sixty dollars with  some unique features like a built-in fan  which they call cryoboost which cools  down your phone while it's wirelessly  charging which will not only improve  battery longevity but it'll stop display  dimming while charging and it'll even  charge your iPhone faster since it won't  slow down due to excessive heat now we  were shocked by how nice this is for the  price because it uses actual real  aluminum parts it has an adjustable  Mount which is super convenient it has  magnetic alignment minutes for your air  pods and unlike many budget three in one  Chargers it comes with an included power  adapter on top of that the extra spacing  and clearance of the main Max a charger  is perfect for the huge camera bump on  the iPhone 14 pro so it won't bump into  it and the cooling fan is surprisingly  quiet but can also be shut off along  with the lights with this button right  here so I think it's the best three in  one charger for the price and now  finally we have number 10 which is the  Razer Max iPhone cooler which  magnetically attaches to the back of  your iPhone to cool it down and it  actually works incredibly well because  it comes with an electronic Peltier  cooling tile that's attached to an  aluminum heat sink and fan which gets  ice cold in seconds the main point of it  is to stop overheating and display  dimming on the iPhone while playing  games or whatever else which was a huge  issue with the iPhone 12 and it's still  around a bit today on the iPhone 14 pro  and this Max iPhone cooler stops say  adding on to that it also comes with  customizable RGB lighting and it uses  USB type c for power with a convenient  on and off switch so it's the best phone  cooler out there which you can find on  Amazon so there you guys go those were  our top 10 useful Max save accessories  for the iPhone 14 lineup and of course  any other iPhone with Max save so if you  found any of those interesting you'll  find links to all of them in the video  description and pinned comment below  once again thank you to moft and Galileo  gear for partnering up on this video be  sure to click the circle button to  subscribe and we'll see you in the next  video  [Music]
 

